- Model: Veo 3.1 Fast
- Category: video-to-video
- Cost: $0.15 / seconds USD (partner)
- Pricing note: For every second of video you generated, you will be charged $0.10 (audio off) or $0.15 (audio on). For example, a 5s video with audio on will cost $0.75.
- License: commercial
- Date: 2025-12-15
- Updated: 2026-04-28
- Tags: extend-video
- Model URL: https://fal.run/fal-ai/veo3.1/fast/extend-video
- Description: Extend Veo-Created Videos up to 30 seconds

TypeScript:

```ts
import { fal } from "@fal-ai/client";

// Configure fal credentials in your runtime environment before running requests.

const result = await fal.subscribe("fal-ai/veo3.1/fast/extend-video", {
  // Confirm the current input schema on the model page before production use.
  input: {
      "prompt": "Restyle the video with cinematic color grading while preserving motion and timing",
      "video_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/falserverless/example_inputs/example_video.mp4"
    },
  logs: true,
  onQueueUpdate: (update) => {
    if (update.status === "IN_PROGRESS") {
      update.logs?.map((log) => log.message).forEach(console.log);
    }
  },
});

console.log(result.data);
console.log(result.requestId);
```

